[{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「那么如果解开了诅咒，你打算怎么办？」","art":{"background":"a639","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……可是目前并没有找到那种方法吧？」","art":{"background":"a639","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"而且必须先想办法处理祟神才行。","art":{"background":"a639","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"我无论如何也不能拖大家的后腿。如果可以，我还是希望能给大家帮上忙。","art":{"background":"a639","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"我就是为此才开始锻炼的。不先解决这个问题的话……根本没有余力去考虑之后的事。","art":{"background":"a639","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「要先处理的事太多了，我还来不及考虑那个」","art":{"background":"a639","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「别说我了，你自己又是怎么打算的？」","art":{"background":"a639","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「我？」","art":{"background":"a639","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「如果诅咒能够解除的话，你应该有什么想做的事情吧？」","art":{"background":"a639","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「我………………」","art":{"background":"a639","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「不告诉你」","art":{"background":"a639","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「也就是说是有的了？」","art":{"background":"a639","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「这是少女的秘密哦」","art":{"background":"a640","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"吃完了烤香鱼的常陆站在我的跟前。","art":{"background":"a54","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「好了，差不多要到约好的时间了。咱们快走吧」","art":{"background":"a54","sprites":[{"asset":"a291","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a54","sprites":[{"asset":"a291","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"越不告诉我，我就越好奇啊。","art":{"background":"a54","sprites":[{"asset":"a284","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"不过最好还是别太多管闲事了。","art":{"background":"a54","sprites":[{"asset":"a284","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「嗯，走吧」","art":{"background":"a54","sprites":[{"asset":"a284","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"可不能让对方等我们。","art":{"background":"a54","sprites":[{"asset":"a322","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"稍微提早一点到场吧。","art":{"background":"a54","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"我们走下斜坡，开始前往约见地点。","art":{"background":"a54","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"走着走着……","art":{"background":"a1","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"声音","text":"「哇！请、请让一下！」","art":{"background":"a1","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"我一回头，就看到眼前冒出一张陌生的面孔。","art":{"background":"a1","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"女子","text":"「呀啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！？」","art":{"background":"a1","sprites":[{"asset":"a642","position":"85%","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「唔哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！？」","art":{"background":"a1","sprites":[{"asset":"a642","position":"85%","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"女子","text":"「哎呀好痛……」","art":{"background":"a643","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……唔……」","art":{"background":"a643","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"一阵足以让人丧失平衡感的强烈冲击突然朝我袭来。","art":{"background":"a643","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"视野不断剧烈摇晃。我踏住双脚，竭力想站稳，却因为肌肉酸痛而使不上力。","art":{"background":"a643","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"结果就这样直接翻倒在地，我真是太逊了。","art":{"background":"a643","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「呃……」","art":{"background":"a643","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……咦？」","art":{"background":"a643","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"没有意料中那么疼。","art":{"background":"a643","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"就像是撞到了什么缓冲物……","art":{"background":"a643","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"另外，感觉有点透不过气。","art":{"background":"a643","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「嗯嗯……？」","art":{"background":"a643","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"怎么感觉……软软的？而且还肉乎乎的？","art":{"background":"a643","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"刚才到底发生了什么……？","art":{"background":"a643","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a643","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"当我理解到自己现状的那一刻，我产生了一种时间凝固的错觉。","art":{"background":"a643","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"——胸、胸部气囊！？","art":{"background":"a643","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"被我当成缓冲垫的东西，居然是少女的酥胸！","art":{"background":"a643","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"那是一对藏都藏不住的、几乎要爆出来的巨乳。","art":{"background":"a643","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"而我的脸就埋在那深邃的山谷之间。","art":{"background":"a643","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「——嗯！？」","art":{"background":"a643","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"女子","text":"「……唔……」","art":{"background":"a644","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"女孩摇晃着脑袋，慢慢恢复了意识。","art":{"background":"a644","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"与此同时，她也注意到我仍被夹在双峰之间……","art":{"background":"a644","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「对、对不起！」","art":{"background":"a645","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"女子","text":"「我才应该道歉！你没事吧？没有受伤吧？」","art":{"background":"a645","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我没事，没有受伤」","art":{"background":"a645","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"女子","text":"「太好了……」","art":{"background":"a646","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「那你有没有受伤？」","art":{"background":"a646","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"女子","text":"「我没事」","art":{"background":"a646","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"我连忙往后一跳，向倒在地上的女孩子伸出手去。","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"女子","text":"「非常感谢你。嘿咻」","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"少女拉着我的手站了起来。","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a647","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"……嗯……果然很大。","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a647","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「有地，你没事吧？你们撞得还挺厉害的……」","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a321","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我没大碍」","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a321","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"我能正常站起来，身上也没有特别疼的地方。","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"我照着轻度热身运动的方式，轻轻活动了下手脚关节，结果一切如常。","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"这样的话应该不会影响到下午的锻炼吧。","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"女子","text":"「真的十分抱歉」","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a648","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「不用再道歉了。我还要谢谢你呢」","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a648","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"女子","text":"「谢谢？？？这种时候也要说谢谢吗？」","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a649","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"女子","text":"「日语真难啊……」","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a650","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「啊，不不，这是非常特殊的例子，你不用在意的」","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a650","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"女子","text":"「……是吗？」","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a651","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"是国外来的游客吗？","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a651","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"流利却又有些笨拙的日语，巨大无比的行李箱。","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a651","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"年轻的女生一个人走在这里……咦？难不成……","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a651","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「幸好这次安然无恙，不过你下次要多加小心哦」","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a651","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a326","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"女子","text":"「刚才是因为下坡时行李冲得太快，停都停不下来……」","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a652","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a326","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"女子","text":"「连我自己都吓了一大跳」","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a648","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a326","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「确实，你的行李箱好大呀。你是一个人来旅游的吗？」","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a628","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"女子","text":"「我的确是一个人来日本的，但我不是来旅游的，而是来留学的」","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a653","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「如果我没猜错的话，你莫非是蕾娜·列支敦瑙尔同学？」","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a653","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「是、是的……就是我没错……」","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a654","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「果然！」","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a654","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「你怎么知道我的名字？」","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a651","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「难不成……你想绑架我！？是神隐吗！？」","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a655","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「不是啦。还有神隐不是绑架的意思」","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a655","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「那、那你到底是……」","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a656","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「初次见面，我叫有地将臣」","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a656","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我是受人所托，专门来接你的，一会儿我会负责把你带到志那都庄」","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a656","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「我叫常陆茉子。今天是来帮忙带路的」","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a657","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a324","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「是吗？那真是帮大忙了，非常谢谢你们」","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a653","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a324","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「哦，非常抱歉。重新自我介绍一下，我叫蕾娜·列支敦瑙尔。以后请多指教」","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a658","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a324","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「看来你提前到了啊。不过……你怎么会走到坡道上去了」","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a658","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a334","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「那里跟约见地点完全不是一个地方吧？」","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a659","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a334","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「因为到得比较早，于是我就自己逛了逛……结果迷路了」","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a660","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「回过神来才发现约定的时间快到了，所以我才会慌慌张张地跑来跑去」","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a661","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「所以才会让行李冲得太快，停都停不下来了？」","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a661","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「嗯……真的非常抱歉」","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a662","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「不，我并没有在责备你」","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a662","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"如果是这样的话，跟我撞在一起也算是不幸中的大幸了吧。","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a662","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「那么接下来怎么办呢？」","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「按照吩咐只要在三点前到旅馆就行了，所以接下来还有些时间」","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「请问……我可以说下自己的愿望吗？」","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a663","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「当然可以。你有想去的地方吗？」","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a663","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a284","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「其实……因为我刚刚一直在跑来跑去……」","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a664","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a284","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「而且午餐也还没吃，所以肚子已经饿扁啦」","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a655","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a655","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「哈哈哈。那我们找个地方吃饭去吧」","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a655","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"比如刚才的盐烤香鱼？","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"……可是刚刚才吃过的啊。","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「你有什么想吃的吗？」","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a284","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「寿司！天妇罗！烤鸡肉串！」","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a665","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"最后这个也太真实了吧……","art":{"background":"a2","sprites":[{"asset":"a665","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"按照列支敦瑙尔小姐的意愿找了一通之后，我们进了一家寿司店。","art":{"background":"a19","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「这里价格适中，吃多了也没问题」","art":{"background":"a1","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「来一份握寿司套餐，拜托多加芥末！」","art":{"background":"a1","sprites":[{"asset":"a666","position":"85%","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"老板娘","text":"「好嘞！」","art":{"background":"a1","sprites":[{"asset":"a666","position":"85%","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「寿司，寿司」","art":{"background":"a1","sprites":[{"asset":"a658","position":"85%","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「居然能吃到寿司，我的感激之情犹如滔滔胶水连绵不绝啊」","art":{"background":"a1","sprites":[{"asset":"a665","position":"85%","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「可惜错了一个字」","art":{"background":"a1","sprites":[{"asset":"a665","position":"85%","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「列支敦瑙尔小姐为什么特地跑来日本留学？」","art":{"background":"a1","sprites":[{"asset":"a665","position":"85%","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「因为我一直都非常喜欢日本。啊，你们叫我蕾娜就行了」","art":{"background":"a1","sprites":[{"asset":"a667","position":"85%","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「可你为什么不去东京之类的大城市，特意跑来穗织？」","art":{"background":"a1","sprites":[{"asset":"a667","position":"85%","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「这个嘛，是因为我的ｇｒｅａｔ－ｇｒｅａｔ－ｇｒａｎｄｆａｔｈｅｒ曾经来过穗织」","art":{"background":"a1","sprites":[{"asset":"a668","position":"85%","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「也就是……」","art":{"background":"a1","sprites":[{"asset":"a668","position":"85%","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「应该是高祖父的意思。也就是祖父的祖父」","art":{"background":"a1","sprites":[{"asset":"a668","position":"85%","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「是的。我爷爷好像从他那听来了很多有关日本的故事。然后把这些故事又说给了子孙们听」","art":{"background":"a1","sprites":[{"asset":"a647","position":"85%","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「所以我们一家老小都很喜欢日本」","art":{"background":"a1","sprites":[{"asset":"a665","position":"85%","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「所以你也对日本产生了兴趣，于是就来到了这里？」","art":{"background":"a1","sprites":[{"asset":"a665","position":"85%","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「是的！穗织的留学生制度并不完善……旅馆雇我当实习员工之后，我才终于把留学手续办了下来」","art":{"background":"a1","sprites":[{"asset":"a653","position":"85%","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「所以你才会一边工作一边留学？」","art":{"background":"a1","sprites":[{"asset":"a653","position":"85%","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「而且，我家本来就不怎么富裕」","art":{"background":"a1","sprites":[{"asset":"a669","position":"85%","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「能够边工作边留学，这种事再好不过了」","art":{"background":"a1","sprites":[{"asset":"a665","position":"85%","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「如果有什么困难的话尽管说。我们会帮忙的」","art":{"background":"a1","sprites":[{"asset":"a665","position":"85%","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「随时都可以找我哦」","art":{"background":"a1","sprites":[{"asset":"a665","position":"85%","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「好的。非常谢谢你们」","art":{"background":"a1","sprites":[{"asset":"a665","position":"85%","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"老板娘","text":"「让您久等了，握寿司好了！」","art":{"background":"a1","sprites":[{"asset":"a665","position":"85%","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「哇噢！寿司，寿司♪」","art":{"background":"a670","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"在谈话告一段落时，握寿司套餐恰好送到了蕾娜面前。","art":{"background":"a670","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"顺便一提，我和常陆已经饱得吃不下了。","art":{"background":"a670","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"因此我们只点了饮料。","art":{"background":"a670","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"我个人是很过意不去，不过听说在游客多的地方，胡乱点单的现象不在少数。","art":{"background":"a670","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"老板并没有怪罪我们，他说这种事已经见怪不怪了。","art":{"background":"a670","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「嘿咻」","art":{"background":"a671","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「啊，筷子……你用得好熟练呀」","art":{"background":"a671","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「我妈妈经常会找一些日本料理的食谱在家里做，所以筷子我也用习惯了」","art":{"background":"a671","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「鸡蛋羹、咖喱、杂炊粥，各种各样的菜她都做过的！」","art":{"background":"a671","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「嗯，不过你说的这些全是用勺子吃的」","art":{"background":"a671","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「那我先开动啦」","art":{"background":"a671","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"蕾娜熟练地拿起筷子，先夹了一个厚蛋烧寿司。","art":{"background":"a672","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"寿司刚入口——","art":{"background":"a672","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「啊唔……嗯、嗯嗯。微微带点甜味，好好吃啊！」","art":{"background":"a673","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「你喜欢就好」","art":{"background":"a673","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「谢谢你，茉子」","art":{"background":"a674","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"满脸笑容的蕾娜，接着把筷子伸向了海胆寿司。","art":{"background":"a675","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「唔……嗯嗯。这个也好好吃！这是什么鱼啊？」","art":{"background":"a674","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「这个是海胆，并不是鱼类……海胆用英文怎么说来着？ＵＮＩ？」","art":{"background":"a674","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「好像是……Ｓｅａｕｒｃｈｉｎ？」","art":{"background":"a674","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「噢！我有听说过。意大利人也吃这种」","art":{"background":"a674","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「大概就是那个」","art":{"background":"a674","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「原来海胆吃起来这么美味啊。太棒了！」","art":{"background":"a674","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「那么接下来是……这个我知道。是乌贼吧。啊唔」","art":{"background":"a676","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"兴高采烈的蕾娜又把乌贼也塞进了嘴里。","art":{"background":"a676","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「——嗯嗯！？」","art":{"background":"a677","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"她的表情突然凝固了。","art":{"background":"a678","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"接着她变得满脸通红，眼睛里也冒出了些许泪花。","art":{"background":"a679","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「非常、好次……唔唔……」","art":{"background":"a680","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「可看你的表情一点都不像很好吃的样子……」","art":{"background":"a680","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「难不成你吃不了芥末？」","art":{"background":"a680","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「但是你刚才不是说……要多加芥末吗？」","art":{"background":"a680","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「我、我没事」","art":{"background":"a680","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「不不，你眼泪都流出来了呀？」","art":{"background":"a680","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「那是内心的汗水。请不要、在意……唔唔唔……」","art":{"background":"a680","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"说完她又吃起了金枪鱼寿司。","art":{"background":"a681","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「唔！？唔……」","art":{"background":"a679","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"蕾娜坐在位子上，手舞足蹈地痛苦挣扎着。","art":{"background":"a679","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"而在一阵痛苦折磨之后，她抬起头来。","art":{"background":"a679","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「这个，很好吃」","art":{"background":"a680","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「你别边哭边说啊……」","art":{"background":"a680","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「看来还是重新点一份不加芥末的比较好」","art":{"background":"a680","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「行啦，别硬撑了」","art":{"background":"a680","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「那些剩下的我们帮你吃掉就行了」","art":{"background":"a680","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「……唔……对不起」","art":{"background":"a682","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"一波三折的寿司吃完之后，蕾娜露出满足的神情。","art":{"background":"a19","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"虽然看她好像还有其他想做的事，不过时间已经不多了。","art":{"background":"a19","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"我们约好以后再陪她出来逛，然后直接前往了志那都庄。","art":{"background":"a19","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「这里就是志那都庄」","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「好漂亮啊！」","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a665","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「稍等一下，我这就去叫人」","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a665","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「打扰了」","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"心子","text":"「好，这就来」","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"心子","text":"「让您久等了。啊，是将臣少爷。您要找大当家是吧，请等一下」","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a52","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我是要找他，不过现在有件更要紧的事」","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a52","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我把新的员工带来了。是外公托我去迎接的」","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a52","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"心子","text":"「是这样啊。非常感谢您在百忙之中抽空来帮忙」","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a52","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"猪谷阿姨深深鞠了一躬之后，转身面向蕾娜。","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a52","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"心子","text":"「初次见面。我是志那都庄的掌柜，名叫猪谷心子」","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a683","position":"出","x":180,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a50","position":"出","x":-180,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「我叫蕾娜·列支敦瑙尔。从今天起要承蒙您照顾了，心子小姐」","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a665","position":"出","x":180,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a50","position":"出","x":-180,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"心子","text":"「在旅馆请叫我掌柜的」","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a665","position":"出","x":180,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a52","position":"出","x":-180,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「是，我明白了。掌柜的」","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a665","position":"出","x":180,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a52","position":"出","x":-180,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"玄十郎","text":"「嗯？哦，已经来了啊，将臣」","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a603","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「嗯，是的。我把人带来了。\n这位就是蕾娜·列支敦瑙尔小姐」","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a603","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"玄十郎","text":"「我是鞍马玄十郎，请多指教」","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a602","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"心子","text":"「这位是志那都庄的大当家」","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a603","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-27.272727272727266,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a683","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a50","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「我是蕾娜·列支敦瑙尔。请您多多指教」","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a603","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-27.272727272727266,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a665","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a50","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"玄十郎","text":"「我很看好你哦」","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a603","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-27.272727272727266,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a665","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a50","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「是！我会努力的！」","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a603","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-27.272727272727266,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a666","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a50","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「我还要谢谢将臣和茉子为我带路。我对你们表示惩治的感谢」","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a647","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「这个发音简直绝了」","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a647","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「……嗯？」","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a657","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"她应该是想说诚挚的感谢吧。","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a657","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「你不必在意，今后请你多多指教」","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a683","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a246","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「好的！请多关照！」","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a666","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a246","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"玄十郎","text":"「将臣，你帮她把行李搬到房间里去。那么大的行李她一个人肯定不好搬」","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a91","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「好的」","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a91","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"听了外公的话之后我点了点头，然后把脸转向常陆。","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a91","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「今天多谢你了，常陆」","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a322","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「哪里哪里」","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a291","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我还有事要找外公，所以还要在这里多留一会儿」","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a291","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「你可以去买东西了。接下来的事我一个人就能对付」","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a291","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「明白了。那我先告辞了」","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a284","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「谢谢你，茉子」","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a665","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a284","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「能帮到你的忙就好」","art":{"background":"a49","sprites":[{"asset":"a665","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a249","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「嘿咻」","art":{"background":"a684","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「啊……是我向往已久的和式房间。太美妙了。有祸祟的房间太棒了！」","art":{"background":"a684","sprites":[{"asset":"a685","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「你还真有勇气啊，我可受不了」","art":{"background":"a684","sprites":[{"asset":"a685","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「将臣讨厌祸祟吗？」","art":{"background":"a684","sprites":[{"asset":"a657","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「是榻榻米吧，榻榻米。我喜欢榻榻米，但是讨厌祸祟」","art":{"background":"a684","sprites":[{"asset":"a657","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「祸祟？」","art":{"background":"a684","sprites":[{"asset":"a659","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「Ｔａ·Ｔａ·Ｍｉ」","art":{"background":"a684","sprites":[{"asset":"a659","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「Ｔａ·Ｔａ·Ｍｉ」","art":{"background":"a684","sprites":[{"asset":"a686","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「榻榻米！」","art":{"background":"a684","sprites":[{"asset":"a686","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「掸子！」","art":{"background":"a684","sprites":[{"asset":"a665","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「这里不是应该说祸祟吗！？」","art":{"background":"a684","sprites":[{"asset":"a665","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「……嗯？」","art":{"background":"a684","sprites":[{"asset":"a651","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"她看上去十分困惑，似乎没搞清我在说什么。","art":{"background":"a684","sprites":[{"asset":"a651","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"好吧……至少掸子比祸崇好一点。","art":{"background":"a684","sprites":[{"asset":"a651","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「祸崇这个词你可别在外面说啊。这会严重影响志那都庄的评价」","art":{"background":"a684","sprites":[{"asset":"a687","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「不可以吗？」","art":{"background":"a684","sprites":[{"asset":"a651","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「至少要等到你能把榻榻米的发音念对」","art":{"background":"a684","sprites":[{"asset":"a651","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「祸崇……唔，好难……」","art":{"background":"a684","sprites":[{"asset":"a662","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「在榻榻米上铺被子睡觉你能接受吗？」","art":{"background":"a684","sprites":[{"asset":"a662","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「可以！这种触感太棒了！而且有种柔软的感觉……整个房间都像是艺术品！」","art":{"background":"a684","sprites":[{"asset":"a665","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"蕾娜露出一副无比陶醉的样子。","art":{"background":"a684","sprites":[{"asset":"a665","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"看她那副样子，她应该是真的很喜欢日本吧。","art":{"background":"a684","sprites":[{"asset":"a665","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"心子","text":"「列支敦瑙尔小姐」","art":{"background":"a684","sprites":[{"asset":"a50","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「在，有什么事吗？」","art":{"background":"a684","sprites":[{"asset":"a683","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a50","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"心子","text":"「虽然你刚到，但是关于你的工作内容还有旅馆的区划我得先跟你说一下，你现在方便吗？」","art":{"background":"a684","sprites":[{"asset":"a683","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a554","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「喔！是工作相关的事情啊，咳咳」","art":{"background":"a684","sprites":[{"asset":"a647","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a554","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「遵命。在下必将努力精进，还请阁下不宁自交……」","art":{"background":"a684","sprites":[{"asset":"a642","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「不对，还请阁下不灵吃教……咦？」","art":{"background":"a684","sprites":[{"asset":"a655","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"心子","text":"「……看来你还得好好学学日语才行啊」","art":{"background":"a684","sprites":[{"asset":"a656","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a688","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「我的日语不行吗？」","art":{"background":"a684","sprites":[{"asset":"a689","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a688","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"心子","text":"「我知道你想表现得很有礼貌，不过像你这句，还请阁下不宁……」","art":{"background":"a684","sprites":[{"asset":"a690","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"心子","text":"「……不吝赐教，现在已经没几个人会这么说了」","art":{"background":"a684","sprites":[{"asset":"a688","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"掌柜的竟然也被带偏了！？","art":{"background":"a684","sprites":[{"asset":"a688","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「是这样吗……」","art":{"background":"a684","sprites":[{"asset":"a689","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a554","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"心子","text":"「不过呢，你的水平就日常生活来说是绝对够用了。甚至可以说绰绰有余」","art":{"background":"a684","sprites":[{"asset":"a689","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a691","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"心子","text":"「我想你一定会很快适应的。咱们一起努力吧」","art":{"background":"a684","sprites":[{"asset":"a689","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a52","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「遵命！」","art":{"background":"a684","sprites":[{"asset":"a692","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"心子","text":"「都说了，这种说法很少用……算了，慢慢来吧」","art":{"background":"a684","sprites":[{"asset":"a554","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"心子","text":"「那就请多指教了，列支敦瑙尔小姐」","art":{"background":"a684","sprites":[{"asset":"a683","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a50","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「在下才要请您务必多多干照」","art":{"background":"a684","sprites":[{"asset":"a642","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a50","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「——多多关燥」","art":{"background":"a684","sprites":[{"asset":"a665","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"面对猪谷阿姨的批评，蕾娜没有露出半点沮丧的神情。","art":{"background":"a684","sprites":[{"asset":"a665","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"她正在用开朗的笑容为自己加油打气。","art":{"background":"a684","sprites":[{"asset":"a665","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"我也不能认输，我要跟外公努力训练！","art":{"background":"a684","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"今天一定要赢下一招！","art":{"background":"a684","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"玄十郎","text":"「嘿呀呀呀呀呀呀呀呀呀呀呀呀呀呀呀呀呀呀！」","art":{"background":"a1","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"对人类来说，有些难关光靠气势是怎么也没办法克服的。","art":{"background":"a1","sprites":[]},"chapter":"2-5"}]